Auditing 500,000 log lines takes 7 s of synchronous work. The pull request changes the loop to:

async function runAudit(lines) {
  for (let i = 0; i < lines.length; i++) {
    tally(parse(lines[i]));
    if (i % 5000 === 0) {
      progressBar.value = i / lines.length;
      await Promise.resolve(); // "let the browser breathe"
    }
  }
}

What does the user see after clicking "Run audit"?
